WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.322
Before wording, identify what stands for the need

00:00:30.322 --> 00:01:00.792
Words and structured conditions address different evidence

00:01:00.792 --> 00:01:40.859
A seed and a relationship offer different paths

00:01:40.859 --> 00:02:12.649
Judgements and monitoring can guide the next search

00:02:12.649 --> 00:02:54.818
An API predicate is different from a task brief

00:02:54.818 --> 00:03:35.194
A good text query can still cover only one route

00:03:35.194 --> 00:04:10.220
Choose wording for the component that receives it

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:48.000
Test the receiver against known relevant records
